          "section": "SECTION-4",
          "section_title": "SECTION 4 - FILING COMPLIANCE RULES",
          "ref": "4.4",
          "page": 2,
          "text": "4.4 Rate changes approved in a filing apply to policies effective on or after the filing effective date and must be implemented in Rate Manual MM-RM-CP-2025.",
